śrīgaṇeśāya namaḥ ||
oṃ namaḥ śrīsiddhilakṣmī devyai ||
oṃ hrīṁ hraṁ hāṁ preṁ kṣoṁ kroṁ namaḥ ||
oṃ hrīṁ hraṁ hāṁ phreṁ kṣoṁ kroṁ namaḥ ||
oṃ hrīṁ hraṁ hāṁ phreṁ oṃ kroṁ namaḥ ||	
oṃ tatsat || oṃ tatsat || oṃ tatsat ||
oṃ asya śrīsiddhilakṣmyā yutākṣaramālāmaṃtrasya bharadvāja ṛṣiḥ mmadhyā 
pratiṣṭhā supratiṣṭhā gāyatryuvliganuṣṭuvvṛhatī paṃktitṛṣṭupjagatpaṃti jagatī 
śarkaryatiśarkarī prakṛtputkṛtayaśchandāṃsi ||
siddhirlakṣmīrdevatā phreṁ vījaṃ ||
khphreṁ śaktiḥ kroṁ kīlakaṃ bhuktimuktisiddhyarthe jape viniyoge ||

<2a> aiṁ oṃ hrīṁ hraṁ phreṁ bhagavaticaṇḍakāpālini siddhilakṣmipratyaṅgire kṣoṁ kroṁ 
śrīṁ strīṁ raktamukhighorāṭṭahāsini bhīmanādini praṇatārtihāriṇi ||
āṁ krīṁ hoṁ kṣoṁ gloṁ śmaśānavāsini himakiraṇaśubhraśarīre ||
bhaktajanatāriṇi phreṁ khphreṁ hsphreṁ hskhphreṁ hsauṁ 
paramasadāśivasāmarasyacāriṇi kātyāyaṇi kāpālini mahāyogini 
kundacandrādhikadhavale mahābhadrarūpaśavādhirūḍhe ||
krauṁ oṃ gluṁ glauṁ vlūṁ sakalasurāsuranarakinnara mano'nurañjini || 

<2b> daityadānavadarpabhañjini ||
pañcavaktradhāriṇi ||
naramuṇḍamālā hāriṇi ||
caturvargaphaladāyini ||
carcarīkaratālikāgāyini ||
hrāṁ hrīṁ hrūṁ hraṁ hrauṁ caṇḍacaṇḍatitaramahāvikaṭagorarāve || 
trividhamahātatvavidyā prakāśini ||
caturdaśabhuvanasantrāsakāra mahāhāsini ||
trīṁ thrīṁ drīṁ dhrīṁ nrīṁ trailokyābhayaśauṇḍabhujadaṇḍadaśakamaṇḍite ||
paramaiśvaryakaraṇabhūte bhūteśvaravāmalocane locanatrayaṃ virājite ||
pheṁ phreṁ khphreṁ hsphreṁ hskhphreṁ himakundadhavalakalevare'pi 
mahānīlanīradapabhe pratyaṅgirā śaktitatvāvatāre ||

<3a> pracaṇḍacaṇḍinimahābhayānake ||
pralamvalamvinicarcarī karatālikā samayasantrāsitatribhuvane || 
nanājanmopacitapāpasañcayakāraṇa mahānarakārṇavavāriṇi ||
hrīṁ hūṁ phreṁ oṃ kroṁ rājyalakṣmi vijayalakṣmi jaya jaya jīva jīva kaha kaha 
sphurasakalaśatrupramardini mahāmāye ||
hrīṁ hūṁ phreṁ phaṭ koṭivrahmāṇḍakavalini mahārāve ||

<3b> hrīṁ hūṁ phreṁ phaṭ paramaśivasāmarasyamayi mahābhīme ||
hrīṁ hūṁ phreṁ phaṭ mahāśmaśānasañcāriṇi mahābhāge ||
hrīṁ hūṁ phreṁ phaṭ mahādāridryaduḥkhadalini mahāhāse ||
hrīṁ hūṁ phreṁ phaṭ kaivalyarūpa svapadaprakāśini mahāghore ||
hrīṁ hūṁ phreṁ phaṭ caturvargaphaladāyini mahācaṇḍe ||
hrīṁ hūṁ phreṁ phaṭ mahājaṭābhārabhāsure mahāgrāse ||
hrīṁ hūṁ phreṁ phaṭ sakalakulākulacakranāyike mahādaye ||

<4a> hrīṁ hūṁ phreṁ phaṭ śuddhasatvaguṇamayaśarīre mahāvidye ||
hrīṁ hūṁ phreṁ phaṭ saṃsāravaṃdhavimocani kalātīte ||
hrīṁ hūṁ phreṁ phaṭ pañcakālānalakṛtāvāse mahāprakāśe ||
hrīṁ hūṁ phreṁ phaṭ mahādordaṇḍamaṇḍalamaṇḍite rudrāvāse ||
hrīṁ hūṁ phreṁ phaṭ caturdaśabhuvanatrāṇaprade mahāvale ||
hrīṁ hūṁ phreṁ phaṭ jvaladagnimukhaghorākāre mahāvrate ||
hrīṁ hūṁ phreṁ phaṭ ditijadanujapramardini mahākalpe ||
hrīṁ hūṁ phreṁ phaṭ satyayugaprakaṭitaprabhāve mahānartaki ||

<4b> hrīṁ hūṁ phreṁ phaṭ bhadraparyaṅkaśayinisamaravijayini paravrahmalayini ||
oṃ kṣoṁ kroṁ namaḥ paramaśivasahacāriṇi naramuṇḍamālābhariṇi 
manorathasiddhikāriṇi ||
oṃ kṣoṁ kroṁ namaḥ śaṃkhakarpūragokṣīraviśadehimaśubhradīrghaniśitā 
bhuguradevavrahmaviṣṇuśivādidevā vidipade ||
oṃ kṣoṁ kroṁ namaḥ sakalamaṅgalapradāyini vividhasakalaiśvaryādhāyini 
śavākāranijavallabhāṅgaśāyini ||

<5a> oṃ kṣoṁ kroṁ namaḥ navakoṭimantramayavigrahe kṛtasakaladaityanigrahe 
vistāritātmabhaktānugrahe ||
oṃ kṣoṁ kroṁ namaḥ candrasūryāgnilocane saṃsāravaṃdhamocane 
nikhilāgamapralocane ||
oṃ kṣoṁ kroṁ namaḥ mahāghoratarakāntāravihitavāse 
tribhuvanabhayajanakadāruṇahāse paramaśivasāmarasyasavilāse ||
oṃ kṣoṁ kroṁ namaḥ vedavedāntaprasiddhānubhāve sa 
madhyāsitamahādāvesantrāsadāyaka mahābhīmarāve ||
oṃ kṣoṁ kroṁ namaḥ utpatti sthāpanasaṃhārakalpanā dakṣesamunmulitavipakṣe 
pakalpitabhaktajanarakṣe ||
oṃ kṣoṁ kroṁ namaḥ anatidīrghakharvapīvari pralayakālajāladhīvari 
mahāśmaśāśavacelacīvari ||
oṃ kṣoṁ kroṁ namaḥ vyāghracarmāmvarā vṛtakaṭimahāpralayakālanati 
saptārṇavaikatāsamarabhaṭi ||
oṃ kṣoṁ kroṁ namaḥ jaya jaya mahāyogeśvariyogasaṃbhave yogagamye yogātīte 
yogarūpe ||

<6a> chrīṁ klīṁ strīṁ svāhā jaya jaya mahājñāneśvari jñānasaṃbhave 
jñānagamyejñātīte jñānarūpe ||
chrīṁ klīṁ strīṁ svāhā jaya jaya mahāmantreśvari maṃtrasaṃbhave mantragamye 
mantrātīte mantrarūpe ||
chrīṁ klīṁ strīṁ svāhā jaya jaya mahāsarveśvari sarvasaṃbhave sarvagamye 
sarvātīte sarvarūpe ||
chrīṁ klīṁ strīṁ svāhā jaya jaya dharmeśvari dharmasaṃbhave dharmagamye 
dharmātīte dharmarūpe ||

<6b> chrīṁ klīṁ strīṁ svāhā jaya jaya mahākāmeśvari kāmasaṃbhave kāmagamye 
kāmātīte kāmarūpe ||
chrīṁ klīṁ strīṁ svāhā jaya jaya mahāmokṣeśvari mokṣasaṃbhave mokṣagamye 
mokṣātīte mokṣarūpe ||
chrīṁ klīṁ strīṁ svāhā jaya jaya mahānirvāṇeśvari nirvāṇasaṃbhave 
nirvāṇagamye nirvāṇatīte nirvāṇarūpe ||
chrīṁ klīṁ strīṁ svāhā jaya jaya mahākaivalye'śvari kaivalyasaṃbhave 
kaivalyagamye kaivalyātīte kaivalyarūpe ||
chrīṁ klīṁ strīṁ svāhā ||

<7a> oṃ hrīṁ hūṁ hāṁ phreṁ kṣoṁ kroṁ jaya jaya jīva jīva triśūlinimahāvalini hūṁ phaṭ 
namaḥ svāhā ||
oṃ hrīṁ hūṁ hāṁ phreṁ kṣoṁ kroṁ jaya jaya jīva jīva guṇātītaparamasadāśivamohini 
apavargārasadohini śuddhasatvaguṇacaitanyānandarohiṇi hūṁ phaṭ namaḥ svāhā 
||

oṃ hrīṁ hūṁ hāṁ phreṁ kṣoṁ kroṁ jaya jaya jīva jīva mahānāgarāja 
bhūṣitadaśabhujadaṇḍe caṇḍacaṇḍātitarakaravāla vinikṛtusakaladaityadānava 
śarīrakhaṇḍe'nirantarā kṛṣṭakaṭhoravāṇakodaṇḍe hūṁ phaṭ namaḥ svāhā ||
oṃ hrīṁ hūṁ hāṁ phreṁ kṣoṁ kroṁ jaya jaya jīva jīva manoviṣayivāgagocare 
triguṇamayasarvakalevare vyāghracarmāmvare hūṁ phaṭ namaḥ svāhā ||
oṃ hrīṁ hūṁ hāṁ phreṁ kṣoṁ kroṁ jaya jaya jīva jīva pracalatarajaṭābhārabhāsura 
himakundacandraghanasānusāra kamvumedure 
jarājanmamṛtyusaṃsārapāśabhidure hūṁ phaṭ namaḥ svāhā ||
oṃ hrīṁ hūṁ hāṁ phreṁ kṣoṁ kroṁ jaya jaya jīva jīva guhyātiguhyaparāpara 
śivaśaktitatvarūḍhe svānandānubhava svaprakāśapadarūḍhe 
sāmarasyavilāsaparyaṅkasamūḍhe hūṁ phaṭ namaḥ svāhā ||

<7b> oṃ hrīṁ hūṁ hāṁ phreṁ kṣoṁ kroṁ jaya jaya jīva jīva prakṛtipuruṣātīta 
niḥśreyasasākṣiṇi trilokīrakṣiṇidaityadānavabhakṣiṇi hūṁ phaṭ namaḥ svāhā ||
oṃ hrīṁ hūṁ hāṁ phreṁ kṣoṁ kroṁ jaya jaya jīva jīva nikhilakaulamatacakrapravartini 
samastadaityadānavarākṣasa bhayakartinimahāmārī paramacakradurbhikṣa 
mahotpātasādhvasanivartini hūṁ phaṭ namaḥ svāhā ||
oṃ hrīṁ hūṁ hāṁ phreṁ kṣoṁ kroṁ jaya jaya jīva jīva vividhadivyāstra 
saṃdhānapāraṅgameṣaḍāmnāya mantramayapañjaravihaṅgame 
samastaśarīrabhūṣaṇī kṛtāṣṭabhujaṅgame hūṁ phaṭ namaḥ svāhā ||
oṃ hrīṁ hūṁ hāṁ phreṁ kṣoṁ kroṁ jaya jaya jīva jīva prapañcātīta niṣkalaturīyākāre 
akhaṇḍanandaparamātmavodhā mṛtadhāre nigamāgamatatvasāre hūṁ phaṭ 
namaḥ svāhā ||

<9a> oṃ hrīṁ hūṁ hāṁ phreṁ kṣoṁ kroṁ jaya jaya jīva jīva mahākhecarī 
pratisiddhyaṣṭakapradāyini kṣīrodārsavodbhūtasudhā devī viśeṣarasapāyini 
trilokī jaṭharotpanna satvamātvavandhanakārimāyini hūṁ phaṭ namaḥ svāhā ||
oṃ hrīṁ hūṁ hāṁ phreṁ kṣoṁ kroṁ jaya jaya jīva jīva vrahmaviṣṇuśivārādhanīya 
caraṇakamalenṛmuṇḍāvalī bhūṣitagalenikhilasurāsurā sahyamahāvale hūṁ phaṭ 
namaḥ svāhā ||

<9b> jaya jaya satyayuge pratyaṅgire ||
jaya jaya tretāyuge siddhilakṣmi ||
jaya jaya dvāparayuge rājyalakṣmi ||
jaya jaya kaliyuge caṇḍakāpālini ||
oṃ aiṁ āṁ hsauṁ sauṁ bhagavati prasīda prasīda jvala jvala prajvala prajvala sphura sphura 
prasphura prasphura caṭa caṭa pracaṭa pracaṭa gāya gāya hasa hasa nṛtya nṛtya kaha 
kaha kili kili kici kici tvara tvara dhāva dhāva hūṁ phreṁ kṣoṁ kroṁ hrīṁ vyomake 
śividyukteśipiṅgakeśi phaṭ svāhā ||

<10a> hūṁ phreṁ kṣoṁ kroṁ hrīṁ bhagamālini bhagapradebhagapriye phaṭ svāhā ||
hūṁ phreṁ kṣoṁ kroṁ hrīṁ madanonmādini śavamāṃsakādini vrahmasaṃvādini 
phaṭ svāhā ||
hūṁ phreṁ kṣoṁ kroṁ hrīṁ narakapālamālābharaṇa saṃsārasāgarataraṇe 
tribhuvanavanditacaraṇe phaṭ svāhā ||
hūṁ phreṁ kṣoṁ kroṁ hrīṁ vamadagnimukhi mahāśaṃkhasamākule varābhayakare 
phaṭ svāhā ||
hūṁ phreṁ kṣoṁ kroṁ hrīṁ koṭikoṭipheruparivṛte karatālikātrāsitatripiṣṭapa 
mahāsamvartakālina nṛtyaprasāritapādādyā na parivartatasaptadvīpe phaṭ 
svāhā ||
hūṁ phreṁ kṣoṁ kroṁ hrīṁ vamadagnimukhi mahāśaṃkhasamākule varābhayakare 
phaṭ svāhā ||
hūṁ phreṁ kṣoṁ kroṁ hrīṁ caraṇavinyāsā vanasrīkṛtakamaṭhaśeṣabhoge 
adhyasitasamastabhūtāntaḥ karaṇe nigamāgameti hāsapurāṇā gāvaratatve phaṭ 
svāhā ||
hūṁ phreṁ kṣoṁ kroṁ hrīṁ bhaktajanahṛdayasantāpanivāriṇi 
duḥkhatrayodbhūtajaṅgama sakalasatvatāriṇi devādhideva 
hṛdayāravindaprakāśanaika mārtaṇḍamaṇḍale phaṭ svāhā ||

<11a> oṃ aiṁ hrīṁ huṁ śrīṁ klīṁ strīṁ huṁ hauṁ hāṁ kṣoṁ kroṁ phreṁ khphreṁ sakaladaitya 
dānavāsurayakṣarāsa bhūtapretapiśaca kuṣmāṇḍaḍākinī śākinī 
skandavināyakaghoṇakakṣetrapāla vrahmarākṣasagandharva 
guhyakasarpanāgagrahanakṣetrabhūtonmādatrividhotpāta caurāgnivanyāsvā 
padayuddhavajropanāśanimegha vividyutapātavarṣe viṣopaviṣakṛtyā 
bhicālachalakapaṭadurbhikṣa nagarabhaṅgadeśopadravastambhana 
mohanavaśīkaraṇadveṣoccāṭanā veśanadanadīsamudrāvartakāntāravātyā 
dahanyākṛmikīṭapaṭaṅgasthalajajalajaśūkapada 
dvipadacatuṣpadaṣaṣṭyadāṣṭapadā nekapad'ghorāndhakāra 
mahāmārīvālagrahahiṃsaka sarvasvāpahārimāyā vidurjanākṣadevi 
dasyuvañcakadivācararātriñcara sandhyācaraśṛṅginakhidaṃṣṭridavokā
vividho 

<12a> dravetyomāṃ rakṣa rakṣa pāhi pāhi pālaya pālaya dhāraya dhāraya trāya 
trāya gopaya gopaya samuddhara samuddhara abhayaṃ kuru kuru prasīda prasīda 
anukaṃpaya anukaṃpaya śatrūnme jahi jahi unmūlaya unmūlaya chindhi chindhai 
bhindhi bhindhi māraya māraya nāśaya hana hana uccāṭaya uccāṭaya stambhaya 
stambhaya matha matha vidhvaṃśaya vidhvaṃśaya traṭa traṭa śoṣaya śoṣaya 
vidrāvaya vidrāvaya trāsaya mohaya mohaya 

<12b> vibhrāmaya vibhrāmaya sphoṭaya sphoṭaya jṛmbhaya jṛmbhaya hara hara 
vikṣobhaya mardaya mardaya dama dama turu turu hili hili kici kici daha daha bhakṣaya 
bhakṣaya kṛntaya kṛntaya saṃcūrṇaya saṃcūrṇaya pīṣa pīṣa coraya coraya 
bhañja bhañja bhasmi kuru kuru ākarṣaya ākarṣaya pātaya pātaya kamyaya 
kamyaya udvejaya udvejaya āveśaya āveśaya unmādaya unmādaya bhāyaya 
bhāyaya lunīhi lunīhi āskandaya āskandaya

<13a> muñca muñca luñca luñca piva piva jāraya jāraya sthāpaya sthāpaya 
svakapāla 
vlauṁ bhagavati glauṁ mahāpracaṇḍini || āṁ vidāriṇi auṁ muṇḍamālini ||
aṁ mahāgrāse hrīṁ pārvati || hraṁ mahābhūtini ||
hrīṁ bhujaṅgakiṇike || ajūṁ pātālavāsini navavījāntaścāriṇi kokāmukhi ||
hūṁ raktatuṇḍi || hūṁ rudradhāre ||
hūṁ ṛkṣakarṇi || hūṁ jālandhari ||
hūṁ vidyuddhāse || hūṁ candrabhāle ||
hūṁ śavarikirāti || hūṁ kuśapāni ||hūṁ kṣīrodārṇavapriye 

<13b> hūṁ sāmarasyalolupe || hūṁ kailāsasañcāriṇi ||
hūṁ bhaktakalpalatike || hūṁ manorathaprade ||
hūṁ diddhyaṣṭakavidhāyini || hūṁ rājyaiśvaryadāyini ||
hūṁ rājarājeśvari || hūṁ vidyutkaṭākṣe ||
hūṁ sudhāsamudramagnenidharivakriṇi ||
hūṁ mahāḍāmari || hūṁ bhaktisevāpraṇave ||
hūṁ caturvargaphalaprade || hūṁ oṃ advaitebhuktiṃ dehi svāhā ||
oṃ agocare siddhiṃ dāpaya svāhā ||
oṃ turīyātīte svapadaṃ darśaya svāhā ||
oṃ cidānandarūpe jñānaṃmayidhehi svāhā ||

<14a> oṃ nādavindu svarūpe yogaṃ prakataya svāhā ||
oṃ caitanyamayākāre sarvajñatāṃ pakalpaya svāhā ||
oṃ mantramayavigrahe śivaśaktisāmarasya vibhāva svāhā ||
oṃ jñānadīpakalike ajñānatimiramayanaya svāhā svāhā ||
oṃ śavdavrahmamayi sarvavidyāṃ mayyavasthāpaya svāhā ||
oṃ saṃsāradāvāgnirūpe janmamṛtyu apana svāhā ||
oṃ bhaktajanavatsare durgatiṃ meśamaya svāhā ||
oṃ trayī svarūpiṇi pāpādunmocaya svāhā ||

<14b> oṃ sarvāntaryāmi nitvatvayi bhaktiṃ vitara svāhā ||
oṃ sarvābhiprāyavedini trivargeṇamāṃyojaya svāhā ||
oṃ prasādasumukhi varerūpachandaya svāhā ||
oṃ nigamāgamāraṇyasiṃhi mamatāhantāmapanuda svāhā ||
oṃ navākṣarī mantrakṛtādhivāse sarvātsaṃkaṭā duttāraya svāhā ||
oṃ sarvāpadaprabhañjani sarveṣāṃnaḥ kuśalaṃ kuru kuru svāhā ||
oṃ śrāṁ klīṁ hsauṁ sauṁ sūryāsane prabhārūpetubhyaṃ namaḥ phaṭ ||
oṃ śrīṁ klīṁ hsauṁ sauṁ candrāsane candrikārūpetubhyaṃ namaḥ phaṭ ||

<15a> oṃ āṁ klīṁ hsauṁ sauṁ pāvakāsane jvālārūpetubhyaṃ namaḥ phaṭ ||
oṃ āṁ klīṁ hsauṁ sauṁ hiraṇyagarbhvāsane sṛṣṭitubhyaṃ namaḥ phaṭ ||
oṃ āṁ klīṁ hsauṁ sauṁnārāyaṇāsane sthitirūpetubhyaṃ namaḥ phaṭ ||
oṃ āṁ klīṁ hsauṁ sauṁ mahābhairavāsane pralayarūpe tubhyaṃ namaḥ phaṭ ||
oṃ āṁ klīṁ hsauṁ sauṁ vedāsane gāyatrī rūpetubhyaṃ namaḥ phaṭ ||
oṃ āṁ klīṁ hsauṁ sauṁ yajñāsane homarūpetubhyaṃ namaḥ phaṭ ||
oṃ āṁ klīṁ hsauṁ sauṁ ācārāsane dharmarūpetubhyaṃ namaḥ phaṭ ||

<15b> oṃ āṁ klīṁ hsauṁ sauṁ parjanyāsane vṛṣṭirūpetubhyaṃ namaḥ phaṭ ||
oṃ āṁ klīṁ hsauṁ sauṁ annāsane prāṇarūpetubhyaṃ namaḥ phaṭ ||
oṃ āṁ klīṁ hsauṁ sauṁ mantrāsane dīkṣārūpetubhyaṃ namaḥ phaṭ ||
oṃ āṁ klīṁ hsauṁ sauṁ vratāsane taporūpetubhyaṃ namaḥ phaṭ ||
oṃ āṁ klīṁ hsauṁ sauṁ anantāsane dharitrirūpetubhyaṃ namaḥ phaṭ ||
oṃ āṁ klīṁ hsauṁ sauṁ nirākārāsane ākāśarūpetubhyaṃ namaḥ phaṭ ||

<16a> oṃ āṁ klīṁ hsauṁ sauṁ tribhuvanāsane sarvaśaktirūpetubhyaṃ namaḥ phaṭ ||
