śrūkapuchaviṣavileya daṃṣṭriromagalabhīti hāriṇī ||
kṣaṁ kṣaṁ kṣaṁ kṣaiṁ kṣaiṁ kṣaiṁ kapaṭivañcakadasyu dhūrtaghātinī ||
bhaṁ bhaṁ bhaṁ bhaiṁ bhaiṁ bhaiṁ vividho padravapraśamani ||
oṃ aiṁ phreṁ hrīṁ hūṁ chrīṁ klīṁ strīṁ hsauṁ namobhagavatyai caṇḍakāpālinyai ||
hāṁ kṣoṁ kroṁ hauṁ āṁ namaḥ pratyaṅgirāyai koṭikoṭidordaṇḍa maṇḍitāyai 
mahābhīma śmaśānanilayāyai mahābhadrahṛdayaparyaṅkādhi rūḍhāyai ||

<32b> krauṁ glauṁ phreṁ khphreṁ hphreṁ hskhphreṁ śūṁ akṣūṁ akṣhrūṁ akṣmchrūṁ 
