agocarāyai apratihatāyai anutpannāyai advaitāyai |
śatakoṭicaraṇanetra sahasravṛndamastake jvala jvala prajvala prajvala sphura sphura 
prasphura prasphura caṭa caṭa pracaṭa pracaṭa kaha kaha dhama dhama hasa hasa gāya 
gāya jaya jaya jīva jīva vyāghracarmāmvare karālarūpiṇi muṇḍamālini ||
phreṁ phreṁ phreṁ kṣoṁ kṣoṁ kṣoṁ kroṁ kroṁ kroṁ dharitrī dhāriṇi vrahmavādini 
vrahmāmṛtamayi namostute pratyaṅgire namostute namostute siddhilakṣmi ||
namostute caṇḍakāpālini namostute sāmrājyādhi daivate ||
namostute mahāmāye arūpevahurūpe viśvarūpe nānārūpe rūpātīte ||

<33b> sakalāsuradaityadānavochādini kṛtyābhicāragrahanakṣetradoṣa praṇāśini ||
yakṣarākṣasa bhūtapiśācavetālapretaḍākinī kūṣmāṇḍaprabhañjani ||
gāyatri sāvitri mahitri prasavitri agnibhayanikṛntani vidyudaśanivarṣasaninyā 
pramardini ||
sāgaravahitranauvātyā ghūrsmikāpramocini rātrya andhakārakāntāra 
dhuḥkhaughasaṃkaṭatāriṇi rājakulaviṣopaviṣajvarādiroga praśamani 
