<34b> pramāṇāvedye pramāṇasiddhidāyini ||
aguṇāvigrahā'nupāsyāsa guṇāvayavopāsanīyā himaśaṃkhakuṇḍavarṇā 
pañcavadanāprativanayanā piṅgalajaṭāmukuṭabhīṣitā ||
vyāghracarmaparīdhānā naramuṇḍamālinī ||
